{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/rirnwu","slideIndex":0,"text":"Roadmap supplied by user. Three-month, 6-12-month and long-term items are planned, not delivered functionality or secured partnerships. ABDM integration is proposed; no certification or approval claimed. Offline-first/zero-connectivity PWA does not imply cloud Gemini or cloud speech transcription can operate offline. ESP32 live vitals capture requires appropriate sensors, engineering validation and clinician review; current NFC wristband is identification hardware, not a validated vital-sign monitor. National-first novelty claim omitted because it was not substantiated. Open-source release is a commitment supplied by user. Repository URL https://github.com/Siddharth-Jamdhade/CareLink was supplied by user; public availability and license could not be verified in this session. Columns and roadmap arrow are editable native PowerPoint shapes, not native SmartArt."}